# WithFestival frontend monorepo

pnpm + Turborepo. Two apps — treat them as separate products.

| App | Path | Stack | Dev |
|-----|------|-------|-----|
| Landing | `apps/www` | Next.js 16 App Router, Tailwind v4, shadcn | `pnpm --filter www dev` |
| Product | `apps/app` | Vite 6, React Router 7, TanStack Query, Zustand, PWA, Sentry | `pnpm --filter app dev` |

## Commands

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm lint
pnpm check-types
pnpm test:ci
pnpm build
pnpm --filter www build
pnpm --filter app build
```

## Conventions

- Prefer root **pnpm** only (no nested `package-lock.json`).
- Match local style: `app` = single quotes (Prettier); `www` = Next/shadcn defaults.
- Path aliases: `www` `@/*` → app root; `app` `@/*` → `src/*`.
- Shared design tokens: `packages/tailwind-config` (used by `app`). Do **not** import unused `@repo/ui`.
- Env: use `.env.example` files. Never commit `.env`. Never put secrets in `VITE_*` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.
- Next.js 16: follow `apps/www/AGENTS.md` and in-repo Next docs.
- Tests: `apps/app` has Jest (coverage gate 90% on a **scoped** surface — see `docs/ENGINEERING_DEBT.md`). Prefer FSD public APIs (`@/features/*`, `@/entities/*`, `@/shared/*`).
- Debt tracker: `docs/ENGINEERING_DEBT.md`.

## Out of scope

Backend services, DB schemas, server migrations, password hashing — belong to the API repo, not this frontend.
